<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Jarvis Hotels.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Jarvis Hotels.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers started coverage of Jarvis Hotels Plc with an &quot;outperform&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Lehman set a price target of 180p on the stock, highlighting the company's tight cost controls and strong earnings momentum.</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit was forecast to rise to 23.7 million stg in the year ended March 1997 from 18.6 million a year before, and to 27.6 million in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
